The immutable calculation_amount protects you when the admin later edits the Excel/register, while the installment table gives you the month-by-month loan history.

One further point: because you said "all these will be applicable if recovery type is loan", I would make number_of_installments, first/last month/year, loan schedule, 25% calculation, remaining balance, and installment APIs conditional on recovery_type === 'loans'. Damage/loss/fine/advance should continue using the normal calculation_amount deduction path.